// A 16x2 character LCD panel (1602A class) driven by an HD44780U controller behind a PCF8574 I2C
// backpack. The model runs the PCF8574 8-bit port (P0 RS, P1 RW, P2 E, P3 backlight, P4..P7 D4..D7)
// driving the HD44780U in 4-bit mode per Hitachi ADE-207-272.
